ARCH.FEEDBACK.VERSION=5.6
ARCH.FEEDBACK.ITR_ID=dtr-builder-iteration-014
ARCH.FEEDBACK.CODER_NAME=opencode-coder-01
ARCH.FEEDBACK.DATE=2026-07-05
ARCH.FEEDBACK.CLARITY_RATING=4
ARCH.FEEDBACK.AMBIGUOUS_LINES=CU.5 address says "control/DtrConfig.scala" but DtrConfig lives in domain layer. Intent was clear — modify DtrConfig wherever it lives.

ITR_GEN steps use custom numbering (STEP1-STEP10) instead of system tensor canonical steps (STEP1-STEP9+STEP8.5). The ITR maps: 1→infrastructure, 2→port+bind+infrastructure, 3→application, 4→domain, 5-7→control, 8→tests, 9→feedback, 10→commits. Functional mapping is correct.
ARCH.FEEDBACK.MISSING_CONTEXT=None
ARCH.FEEDBACK.TOO_MUCH_DETAIL=None
ARCH.FEEDBACK.ARCHITECTURE_DEVIATION=None — all code follows HEX, DI, DIP, NO_CROSS_LAYER, PORT_FLOW_OUT_IN constraints.
ARCH.FEEDBACK.DOTENV_CLARITY=N/A
ARCH.FEEDBACK.LANGUAGE_COVERAGE=5
ARCH.FEEDBACK.STEP_ORDER_ISSUES=None
ARCH.FEEDBACK.SUGGESTIONS=(1) Consider aligning ITR step numbering with system tensor canonical steps. (2) Add a CU for testing the CliParser baseline flags directly.
ARCH.FEEDBACK.TIME_TAKEN=40

CODER_FEEDBACK.OBSERVATIONS
OBSERVATION.SEVERITY.0=MINOR — ITR custom step numbering diverges from system tensor canonical steps. Functionally equivalent.

OBSERVATION.SEVERITY.1=TRIVIAL — CU.5 address references "control/DtrConfig.scala" but actual file is in domain layer. Implemented correctly in domain layer.

OBSERVATION.SEVERITY.2=MINOR — Designer requested removal of --package flag post-implementation. Removed --package from CliParser, CreateBaselineMode, BaselineDtrGenerator, seed template, and tests. Seed template simplified to use APP_NAME as namespace qualifier instead of PACKAGE_NAME. --root now sets DTR root path in baseline mode.

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP1=CREATE_SEED_TEMPLATE
STEP1.VERDICT=PASS
STEP1.DETAIL=Created src/main/resources/seed/seed-dtr.dtr with golden architecture template. Template uses {{APP_NAME}} as namespace qualifier (no package concept). Placeholder tokens: {{APP_NAME}}, {{ROOT_PATH}}, {{LANGUAGE}}, {{TIMESTAMP}}.
STEP1.FILES=src/main/resources/seed/seed-dtr.dtr

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP2=IMPLEMENT_SEED_TEMPLATE_LOADER
STEP2.VERDICT=PASS
STEP2.DETAIL=Created SeedTemplateLoader port trait in application layer and ClasspathSeedTemplateLoader adapter in infrastructure layer. Proper DIP: application owns the interface, infrastructure implements it.
STEP2.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/application/SeedTemplateLoader.scala, src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/infrastructure/ClasspathSeedTemplateLoader.scala

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP3=IMPLEMENT_BASELINE_GENERATOR
STEP3.VERDICT=PASS
STEP3.DETAIL=Created BaselineDtrGenerator application service. generate(appName, rootPath, language) substitutes 4 placeholder tokens ({{APP_NAME}}, {{ROOT_PATH}}, {{LANGUAGE}}, {{TIMESTAMP}}). No package concept.
STEP3.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/application/BaselineDtrGenerator.scala

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP4=UPDATE_DTR_CONFIG
STEP4.VERDICT=PASS
STEP4.DETAIL=Added Mode sealed trait with ExtractMode and CreateBaselineMode(appName, language). No packageName field.
STEP4.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/domain/DtrConfig.scala

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP5=UPDATE_CLI_PARSER
STEP5.VERDICT=PASS
STEP5.DETAIL=Added --create-baseline-dtr, --app-name, --language flags. No --package flag. --root sets DTR root path in baseline mode. Updated help text.
STEP5.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/control/CliParser.scala

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP6=UPDATE_DTR_APP
STEP6.VERDICT=PASS
STEP6.DETAIL=DtrApp.main matches on config.mode. Baseline mode generates DTR and writes via DtrWriter.
STEP6.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/control/DtrApp.scala

