STEP7.VERDICT=PASS
STEP7.DETAIL=Added seedTemplateLoader to Container.
STEP7.FILES=src/main/scala/dtrbuilder/control/Container.scala

CODER_FEEDBACK.STEP8=GENERATE_TESTS
STEP8.VERDICT=PASS
STEP8.DETAIL=Created SeedTemplateSpec (16 tests) and BaselineDtrGeneratorSpec (10 tests). Seed tests verify no PACKAGE_NAME/PACKAGE_PATH tokens remain. Generator tests verify APP_NAME, ROOT_PATH, LANGUAGE, TIMESTAMP substitution, comment stripping, KEY=VALUE format, various app names and root paths. All 161 tests pass (was 135, +26 new).
STEP8.FILES=src/test/scala/dtrbuilder/baseline/SeedTemplateSpec.scala, src/test/scala/dtrbuilder/baseline/BaselineDtrGeneratorSpec.scala

